{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17347","headline":"奉和崔阁老清明日候许阁老交直之际辱裴阁老书招云与考功苗曹长先城南游览独行口号因以简赠 · 权德舆","name":"奉和崔阁老清明日候许阁老交直之际辱裴阁老书招云与考功苗曹长先城南游览独行口号因以简赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫禁宿初回，清明花乱开。\n相招直城外，远远上春台。\n谏曹将列宿，几处期子玉。\n深竹与清泉，家家桃李鲜。\n折芳行载酒，胜赏随君有。\n愁疾自无悰，临风一搔首。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}